{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "dd1189056be59934",
			"type": "group",
			"x": -1220,
			"y": -300,
			"width": 1620,
			"height": 3688,
			"label": "Poilling"
		},
		{
			"id": "c947c4b71cb618b9",
			"type": "group",
			"x": 1428,
			"y": 4240,
			"width": 2086,
			"height": 1900,
			"label": "Stale data problem 或是 coherence problem"
		},
		{
			"id": "5fbeaf230a62f875",
			"type": "group",
			"x": 3720,
			"y": -316,
			"width": 1400,
			"height": 2478,
			"label": "I/O processor"
		},
		{
			"id": "f98358fd32c2b178",
			"type": "group",
			"x": 2460,
			"y": -316,
			"width": 1054,
			"height": 3291,
			"label": "DMA"
		},
		{
			"id": "f717609f5f7c443c",
			"type": "group",
			"x": 1434,
			"y": 3200,
			"width": 2080,
			"height": 916,
			"label": "DMA 遇到 Virtual Memory 的問題"
		},
		{
			"id": "a007a2762c63c15f",
			"type": "group",
			"x": 660,
			"y": -280,
			"width": 1420,
			"height": 1225,
			"label": "Interrupt"
		},
		{
			"id": "48756f30e2246dda",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "\n- 方法一：讓 **DMA 以虛擬位址** 工作，允許跨越頁邊界的傳輸。  \n    在這種設計中，**DMA 單元** 內建少量對映表項，用來把虛擬位址對映到實體位址再進行傳輸。（類似 IOMMU/DMAR 的小型映射）\n    \n- 方法二：由 **作業系統** 把一次 DMA 傳輸**切成多段**，每段都限制在**單一實體頁**內；把這些段以**鏈結（chaining）**交給 I/O 處理器或智慧型 DMA，一口氣執行整串。\n    \n- 方法三：同樣由 **作業系統分段**到單一頁，但不做鏈結，**OS 逐段發出請求**，每段完成再請下一段。\n    \n\n速記：  \n虛擬位址法＝硬體做轉換；鏈結分段＝硬體一次跑完整串；逐段分段＝OS 一段一段下單。",
			"x": 2292,
			"y": 3751,
			"width": 520,
			"height": 345,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "d05e802e886b9301",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_11_DataTransfer/20-Poilling.png",
			"x": -480,
			"y": 1000,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 231
		},
		{
			"id": "6570d0f00b1dc3db",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_11_DataTransfer/16-Poilling.png",
			"x": -480,
			"y": 660,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 232
		},
		{
			"id": "199cfef3720b81ff",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- OS 的版本叫做 busy bit 那計組叫做 done bit",
			"x": -29,
			"y": 421,
			"width": 389,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "82f2cfa0d94afb58",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "1. 那剛剛在執行 Process2 但是要執行 ISR 所以要先把 Process2 存起來\n2. 把 B 放到 Data\n3. 然後把 Restore Process2\n4. 給控制全給 Process2",
			"x": 1680,
			"y": 734,
			"width": 329,
			"height": 158,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "f88c5c6ff3bf7816",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_11_DataTransfer/17-Interrupt.png",
			"x": 1200,
			"y": 700,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 225
		},
		{
			"id": "36deeee5a4db75f0",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_11_DataTransfer/05-Interrupt - I O interrupt 跟指令沒有關係.png",
			"x": 1200,
			"y": -260,
			"width": 399,
			"height": 222
		},
		{
			"id": "819f9c851e6e6212",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_11_DataTransfer/13-Interrupt.png",
			"x": 1200,
			"y": 370,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 231
		},
		{
			"id": "6b16c140d5201f59",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "產生 interrupt，當 A 印完了，然後去執行 ISR",
			"x": 1680,
			"y": 458,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 55,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "530601cb3ffa59a5",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- timer 又到了那麼那現在要 print b 那麼又把 done bit 變成 0",
			"x": 6,
			"y": 2137,
			"width": 374,
			"height": 87,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "fc60bb18e0332810",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_11_DataTransfer/31-Poilling - 一樣把控制全交給 process2.png",
			"x": -480,
			"y": 2424,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 230
		},
		{
			"id": "5a43427e9f51e83c",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_11_DataTransfer/33-Poilling.png",
			"x": -480,
			"y": 2780,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 233
		},
		{
			"id": "f48e3e9a408a8b3f",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_11_DataTransfer/29-Poilling.png",
			"x": -480,
			"y": 2060,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 233
		},
		{
			"id": "a87a4fc46953536a",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_11_DataTransfer/07-Interrupt - I O interrupt 跟指令沒有關係.png",
			"x": 680,
			"y": -229,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 161
		},
		{
			"id": "1fd219894d631210",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "1. 先 save Process1 的 PCB\n2. 控制權交給 OS\n3. 和 Data 寫入\n4. 然後把 I/O Device command 設定\n5. Process1 waiting 那麼就會 restore process2 控制全在交給 process2",
			"x": 1700,
			"y": 62,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 214,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "ed63465fda6d62fa",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "1. I/O interrupt 跟指令沒有關係\n2. I/O interrupt 比起 exception 還帶來更多訊息，因為可以知道哪個 I/O 設備發生 interrupt\n",
			"x": 690,
			"y": -5,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 91,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "4854bfc798de0eae",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_11_DataTransfer/09-Interrupt - 先 save Process1 的 PCB.png",
			"x": 1200,
			"y": 40,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 236
		},
		{
			"id": "02a8c52f9d92a6ec",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- 一樣把控制全交給 process2",
			"x": 40,
			"y": 2514,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 50,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "9de61d97116c1878",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- 然後印好了，所以要把 done bit 變成 0 然後恢復 process 1",
			"x": 37,
			"y": 3225,
			"width": 343,
			"height": 58,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "6924d77e86f64058",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- 再檢查一次，如果還是 1 代表沒有空繼續給 process2 ==但是要記得這邊會先存 PCB 放到 kernel memory，切換 Process 都會這樣==然後等待下一次 timer interrupt",
			"x": 40,
			"y": 2823,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 148,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "d4e0c83dd1435a75",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_11_DataTransfer/34-Poilling.png",
			"x": -480,
			"y": 3140,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 228
		},
		{
			"id": "f28d997cd70f0b78",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_11_DataTransfer/23-Poilling.png",
			"x": -480,
			"y": 1340,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 226
		},
		{
			"id": "c23310b0b1568267",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- 因為 process1 在 I/O 也就是 waiting 那麼控制全先教給 process2\n- timer 會定時發中斷然後就會跳到 OS 就會去看 I/O 的狀態也就是 done bit or busy bit 那麼如果，status 還是 0 也就是還沒有做完那麼就繼續執行 Process2",
			"x": -20,
			"y": 1025,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 181,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "99e0fbd5530aa283",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- 那麼假設剛剛在 timer 觸發 interrupt 前還沒有做完 I/O ，但是那控制全還在 Process2 那要再等下一次的 timer\n- 且 A 這時候印完了",
			"x": -3,
			"y": 1753,
			"width": 383,
			"height": 121,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "321981955b00739f",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_11_DataTransfer/26-Poilling.png",
			"x": -480,
			"y": 1700,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 227
		},
		{
			"id": "83053bad182162db",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- OS 間單來說就是會定期檢查 I/O 設備的狀態那麼並且是使用 polling routine\n- 那麼就是簡單，但是會很浪費時間",
			"x": -1105,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 365,
			"height": 91,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "dce1357ce53e2a15",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_11_DataTransfer/08-Poilling.png",
			"x": -480,
			"y": 20,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 224
		},
		{
			"id": "15aed7cc17b41973",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_11_DataTransfer/04-Poilling.png",
